# <type>(<scope>): <short summary in imperative mood>
# │<----                   Max 72 characters                    ---->│
#
# ─── TYPES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# feat     : A new feature for the user
# fix      : A bug fix for the user
# docs     : Changes to documentation only
# style    : Formatting, missing semi-colons, no code logic changes
# refactor : Refactoring production code without changing behavior
# perf     : Code change that improves performance
# test     : Adding missing tests or correcting existing tests
# build    : Changes affecting build system, vite, npm, or dependencies
# ci       : Changes to CI/CD workflows and configuration files
# chore    : Routine maintenance, config tweaks, tool configurations
# revert   : Reverts a previous commit
#
# ─── SCOPES (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# web, ui, layout, theme, seo, assets, config, deps, root
#
# ─── BODY (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Motivation for the change and contrast with previous behavior.
# Wrap lines at 72 characters.
#
# ─── FOOTER (optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description of breaking change>
# Closes #<issue-number>
